{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013Rp6q1H1HRaMd6e8EdDEtK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSynthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\n2\tExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\n3\tThe host launches the executable declared by package.json and .mcp.json. src/ is development source; release/ is the shipped runtime snapshot. The supplied client bounds operation arguments and refuses redirects. The host enforces an 8 KiB line limit before writing stdin; host enforcement is not supplied. Stderr is shipped to a diagnostics service whose readers must not receive LEDGER_TOKEN. This is a single-principal stdio component, not an HTTP server. Downstream response limits, credential revocation, host sandboxing and actual published-package provenance are outside scope.\n4\tLaunch working directory is this package root; the host supplies LEDGER_TOKEN from its secret store.\n5\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e86c25ee-c1fa-46ec-93b8-a5c4e510ff53","uuid":"7a6b8212-f312-42e1-9e9b-132805bceda1","timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:57:47.167Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-grader-calibration-7_irs5rq/repo/README.md","content":"Synthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\nExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\nThe host launches the executable declared by package.json and .mcp.json. src/ is development source; release/ is the shipped runtime snapshot. The supplied client bounds operation arguments and refuses redirects. The host enforces an 8 KiB line limit before writing stdin; host enforcement is not supplied. Stderr is shipped to a diagnostics service whose readers must not receive LEDGER_TOKEN. This is a single-principal stdio component, not an HTTP server. Downstream response limits, credential revocation, host sandboxing and actual published-package provenance are outside scope.\nLaunch working directory is this package root; the host supplies LEDGER_TOKEN from its secret store.\n","numLines":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":5}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013Rp6q1H1HRaMd6e8EdDEtK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
